    <string name="tutorial_intro">Goal: move all your checkers around the board and bear them off before your opponent.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_setup">Your checkers start on several points. Stacks protect each other; a single checker is vulnerable.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_roll">Roll the dice. Each die can move one checker by that many points.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_move">Drag one of your checkers. Green hints show legal destinations.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_hit">If you land on one opposing checker, it is hit and sent to the bar.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_bar">A checker on the bar must re-enter before you can move other checkers.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_bear_off">When all your checkers are in your home board, move them off the board to win.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_finished">Nice. Keep playing this guided game and use the hints whenever a move is available.</string>

